00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:22.360
Like you, Rad Gravity doesn't just have like the sprites that you play the, like the normal game in.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:31.080
There's also like the high fidelity version that you see when he's in his ship and it's actually unnerving.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:37.240
Uh, the, the weird like profile view that you get of him with the giant chin.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:44.080
And it, like it, it's kind of how I, I, this sounds weird, but it's how, how, how I used to draw.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:46.300
I felt very strange.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:06:00.120
The problem with Rad Gravity as a, as an individual, uh, or as a character, as a character design here is that they drew, uh, the body and the body, uh, makes sense to me.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:03.120
Uh, it's all like rightly proportioned.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:09.380
