00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.900
And so he, I get it.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:18.800
Like he's supposed to be this, like, you know, uh, Flash Gordon, uh, you know, Saturday morning space opera.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.640
