00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.440
It feels like he has too much head.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.100
Very much is too much head.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:44.600
I think that's where the unnerving characteristics came from.

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:57.980
In the, uh, in the, in the comic book manual, we also learned that, um, there was a, a guy named Agathos who was once a human, now a giant brain.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.060
